  "prefLabel": "Ncr 843.01 Uses of Grant-In-Aid",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 843.01 Uses of Grant-In-Aid. Grant-in-aid (GIA) shall be used for the development and maintenance of OHRV and snowmobile trails on private, state, federal, or municipal lands. All state, federal, or municipal permits required shall be the responsibility of the applicant applying for GIA.\n\nSource. #14293, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr800.html"
}
